uiSelect-root MuiSelect-select jss6 MuiSelect-selectMenu MuiInputBase-input MuiInput-input" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-haspopup="listbox" style="background:none">All around the world</div><input aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="MuiSelect-nativeInput" value="overall"/><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSelect-icon" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5z"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="mini-select-wrap"><span class="drop-down-arrow"><img src="https://cdn.arc.dev/arc-next-landing/images/freelance-developer-rates/icon-chevronl-down.svg"/></span><select><option value="overall">All around the world</option><option value="North America">North America</option><option value="Latin America">Latin America</option><option value="Western Europe">Western Europe</option><option value="Eastern Europe">Eastern Europe</option><option value="Middle East">Middle East</option><option value="Asia &amp; Pacific">Asia &amp; Pacific</option><option value="Australia &amp; New Zealand">Australia &amp; New Zealand</option><option value="Africa">Africa</option></select></div></div><div class="filter filter--experience"><img src="https://cdn.arc.dev/arc-next-landing/images/freelance-developer-rates/experience.svg"/><div class="select-wrap"><div class="MuiFormControl-root MuiTextField-root MuiFormControl-fullWidth"><div class="MuiInputBase-root MuiInput-root jss1 MuiInput-underline jss3 MuiInputBase-fullWidth MuiInput-fullWidth MuiInputBase-formControl MuiInput-formControl" style="font-family:var(--font-open-sans, &#x27;Open Sans&#x27;)"><div class="MuiSelect-root MuiSelect-select jss6 MuiSelect-selectMenu MuiInputBase-input MuiInput-input" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-haspopup="listbox" style="background:none">All experience levels</div><input aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" class="MuiSelect-nativeInput" value="overall"/><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSelect-icon" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5z"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="mini-select-wrap"><span class="drop-down-arrow"><img src="https://cdn.arc.dev/arc-next-landing/images/freelance-developer-rates/icon-chevronl-down.svg"/></span><select><option value="overall">All experience levels</option><option value="senior">Senior</option><option value="mid_level">Mid Level</option><option value="junior">Junior</option></select></div></div></div></div><div class="content-wrap"><h2>Blockchain Developer Hourly Rate Distribution</h2><div class="jsx-e3b322eac8b4581b chart"><div class="recharts-responsive-container" style="width:100%;height:100%;min-width:0"></div></div><div class="rate-wrap"><div class="rate"><h3 class="rate__text">Average Hourly Rate:</h3><span class="rate__range rate__range--average">$81-100</span></div><div class="rate"><h3 class="rate__text">Median Hourly Rate:</h3><span class="rate__range rate__range--median">$61-80</span></div></div><br/><div class="summary"><h3>How much <!-- -->Blockchain<!-- --> developers charge?</h3><div class="jsx-53c4df441f0ecf7f"><div class="jsx-53c4df441f0ecf7f summary"><p>Blockchain is an electronic ledger that can be openly shared among users to create an unalterable transaction record. Blockchain engineers have to design protocols, plan for adversarial incentives, and do loads of assumptions testing. In 2017, blockchain developers ranked second among the top 20 fastest-growing job skills. Between 2016 and 2017, there was a 115% increase in job postings for blockchain developers, who are versed in JavaScript, C++, Python, cryptography, and/or machine learning. Blockchain developers typically charge $81-100/hr, on average. As the demand for blockchain developers continue to increase, their hourly range may increase as well.</p>
</div></div><p>When hiring Blockchain developers, be sure to also consider the difference in
  hourly rates for different engagement types, such as temp, part-time, and
  freelance. Developers that are hired for full-time jobs may charge different
  rates if you want to someone who is available on-site versus fully remote.</p></div><div class="learn-more"><a class="learn-more__link">Learn more about our data<img src="https://cdn.arc.dev/arc-next-landing/images/freelance-developer-rates/icon-chevronl-down.png"/></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="jsx-875810730 developers __variable_2141a7"><h2 class="jsx-875810730 developers__title">Connect with top talent for your <!-- -->blockchain<!-- --> needs</h2><div class="jsx-875810730 developers__list"><div data-testid="dev-card" class="sc-e2581dba-0 icwJMK"><div class="sc-e2581dba-1 kihKAf"><div class="sc-e2581dba-3 iNbote"><div class="lazyload-wrapper "><div class="ui__sc-19rdopt-0 fFwSdn cui-avatar-image"><img alt="Dez C. - Blockchain developer in undefined" src="https://assets.codementor.io/avatar/default.png"/></div></div></div><div class="sc-e2581dba-4 juJjyJ">Dez C.</div><span class="sc-e2581dba-5 iNYuao">Senior Blockchain developer</span><p class="sc-e2581dba-6 bxivCu">Accomplished <em>blockchain</em> engineer and technical leader adept at designing, developing, and deploying decentralized applications, smart contracts, and <em>blockchain</em> solutions using Ethereum, <em>Solidity</em>, JavaScript, React, and project management skills.

Accomplishments:

- Led a team of 4 overseeing frontend development initiatives using Next.js, React Native, and TailwindCSS

