Issue Resolution</p><div class="sc-e2581dba-7 Uovdy"><a href="https://arc.dev/hire-developers/blockchain" class="sc-e2581dba-9 fcHHYM"><span filter="" class="ui__sc-38dh2t-0 dPpYTq"><img src="https://da2f8uix4p8om.cloudfront.net/20231208igj0jiqhzes/categories/blockchain.svg" alt="Blockchain developers" loading="eager"/></span><span>Blockchain</span></a><a href="https://arc.dev/hire-developers/solidity" class="sc-e2581dba-9 fcHHYM"><span filter="" class="ui__sc-38dh2t-0 dPpYTq"><img src="https://da2f8uix4p8om.cloudfront.net/20231208igj0jiqhzes/categories/solidity.svg" alt="&lt;em&gt;Solidity&lt;/em&gt; developers" loading="eager"/></span><span><em>Solidity</em></span></a><a href="https://arc.dev/hire-developers/typescript" class="sc-e2581dba-9 jhToLh"><span filter="" class="ui__sc-38dh2t-0 dPpYTq"><img src="https://da2f8uix4p8om.cloudfront.net/20231208igj0jiqhzes/categories/typescript.svg" alt="TypeScript developers" loading="eager"/></span><span>TypeScript</span></a><a href="https://arc.dev/hire-developers/rust" class="sc-e2581dba-9 jhToLh"><span filter="" class="ui__sc-38dh2t-0 dPpYTq"><img src="https://da2f8uix4p8om.cloudfront.net/20231208igj0jiqhzes/categories/rust.svg" alt="Rust developers" loading="eager"/></span><span>Rust</span></a><a href="https://arc.dev/hire-developers/ethereum" class="sc-e2581dba-9 jhToLh"><span>Ethereum</span></a><a href="https://arc.dev/hire-developers/ai" class="sc-e2581dba-9 jhToLh"><span filter="" class="ui__sc-38dh2t-0 dPpYTq"><img src="https://da2f8uix4p8om.cloudfront.net/20231208igj0jiqhzes/categories/ai.svg" alt="AI developers" loading="eager"/></span><span>AI</span></a></div></div><div class="sc-e2581dba-2 edWwgg"><button gtm-trigger="custom_event" custom-event-value="Hire Talent CTA" class="ui__sc-1mmo7mk-0 dRjvD"><span>Hire now</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="dev-card" class="sc-e2581dba-0 icwJMK"><div class="sc-e2581dba-1 kihKAf"><div class="sc-e2581dba-3 iNbote"><div class="lazyload-wrapper "><div class="ui__sc-