5.046 4 24 4S4 13.009 4 24.122C4 34.166 11.314 42.49 20.875 44V29.939h-5.078v-5.817h5.078V19.69c0-5.043 2.986-7.829 7.554-7.829 2.188 0 4.477.393 4.477.393v4.952h-2.522c-2.484 0-3.259 1.551-3.259 3.143v3.774h5.547l-.887 5.817h-4.66V44C36.686 42.49 44 34.166 44 24.122" id="Fill-1" fill="#0A0B09"></path></g></g></g></svg></span></a></div></div></div></div></footer></div></div><script id="__NEXT_DATA__" type="application/json" crossorigin="anonymous">{"props":{"pageProps":{"tracking":{"appinfoData":{"lp_skill_role":"developer","lp_skill":"Blockchain"}},"category":{"name":"Blockchain","displayName":"Blockchain","urlString":"blockchain","lowQuality":false},"talents":[{"firstName":"Dez","lastInitial":"C","username":"dezcalimese","avatarUrl":"https://assets.arc.dev/linkedin-sync-assets/1643407551352","displayCountry":"United States","city":"The Bronx","discipline":"blockchain","seniority":"senior","jobTypesOpenTo":"permanent_and_contract","timeZoneOffset":-18000,"jobRole":"engineering","jobTitle":"Founding Engineer","about":"Accomplished \u003cem\u003eblockchain\u003c/em\u003e engineer and technical leader adept at designing, developing, and deploying decentralized applications, smart contracts, and \u003cem\u003eblockchain\u003c/em\u003e solutions using Ethereum, \u003cem\u003eSolidity\u003c/em\u003e, JavaScript, React, and project management skills.\n\nAccomplishments:\n\n- Led a team of 4 overseeing frontend development initiatives using Next.js, React Native, and TailwindCSS\n\n- Contributed high-quality code focused on meeting project timelines as CTO of a \u003cem\u003eblockchain\u003c/em\u003e startup\n\n- Developed a decentralized staking application enabling users to earn interest through smart contracts\n\n- Created a decentralized RSVP application using \u003cem\u003eSolidity\u003c/em\u003e, Hardhat, Next.js, Tailwind, and GraphQL\n\n- Led the design and development of a decentralized exchange enabling trading of custom tokens for Ethereum\n\nProven Areas of Expertise:\n\n- \u003cem\u003eBlockchain\u003c/em\u003e Application Development | Technical Team Leadership | Full-Stack Development\n\n- Complex Problem Solving | Cross-Functional Collaboration | Programming Languages\n\n- \u003cem\u003eBlockchain\u003c/em\u003e Protocols and Frameworks | Testing \u0026 Deployment | Process \u0026 Tool Knowledge\n\n- Communication \u0026 Mentorship | Agile Methodologies | Continuous Improvement\n\nI am excited to join a company at the forefront of \u003cem\u003eblockchain\u003c/em\u003e technology to continue growing as an engineer and technical leader. With my expertise in \u003cem\u003eblockchain\u003c/em\u003e development and experience managing software teams and projects, I am eager to take on new challenges and responsibilities. Please reach out to discuss current opportunities in \u003cem\u003eblockchain\u003c/em\u003e engineering and management roles overseeing software development lifecycles, resources, budgets, and strategic initiatives. I am passionate about leveraging my technical knowledge and leadership capabilities to deliver innovative \u003cem\u003eblockchain\u003c/em\u003e solutions as part of a forward-thinking organization.\n\nSkills:\n\n\u003cem\u003eBlockchain\u003c/em\u003e Development:\n\nSmart Contracts\n\u003cem\u003eSolidity\u003c/em\u003e\nDecentralized Applications (DApps)\nEthereum\nERC-20 Tokens\n\u003cem\u003eBlockchain\u003c/em\u003e Protocols\nCryptocurrency\nMulti-sig Wallets\nNFT (Non-Fungible Token)\n\u003cem\u003eBlockchain\u003c/em\u003e Industry Trends\n\u003cem\u003eWeb3\u003c/em\u003e\n\nSoftware Engineering:\n\nFull-Stack Development\nNext.js\nReact Native\nReact\nTailwindCSS\nGraphQL\nWeb3Storage\nHardhat\nScaffold-Eth\nCode Reviews\nTesting and Debugging\nCode Quality\nEmerging Technologies\nProgramming Languages\nDocumentation\n\nProject Management:\n\nTeam Leadership\nCross-Functional Collaboration\nProject Planning\nProject Timelines\nBudget Management\nCode Deployment\nTechnology Leadership\nStrategic Guidance\nBug Reporting\nContinuous Improvement\nTechnical Requirements\nStakeholder Collaboration\nComponent Integration\nProduct Development\nIssue Resolution","vetted":true,"expertises":[{"displayName":"\u003cem\u003eSolidity\u003c/em\u003e","urlString":"solidity","hasSufficientLocalTalent":false},{"displayName":"TypeScript","urlString":"typescript","experience":4,"hasSufficientLocalTalent":false},{"displayName":"Rust","urlString":"rust","hasSufficientLocalTalent":false},{"displayName":"Ethereum","urlString":"ethereum","hasSufficientLocalTalent":false},{"displayName":"AI","urlString":"ai","hasSufficientLocalTalent":false}],"companyTypes":["Startup"],"employments":[{"companyLogo":null,"companyName":"Omo Protocol","categories":[{"urlString":"typescript","name":"TypeScript","hasSufficientLocalTalent":false},{"urlString":"rust","name":"Rust","hasSufficientLocalTalent":false},{"urlString":"ethereum","name":"Ethereum","hasSufficientLocalTalent":false},{"urlString":"solidity","name":"\u003cem\u003eSolidity\u003c/em\u003e","hasSufficientLocalTalent":false},{"urlString":"ai","name":"AI","hasSufficientLocalTalent":false}]},{"companyLogo":null,"companyName":"Bricks","categories":[]},{"companyLogo":null,"companyName":"Minting Melodies","categories":[]}],"projectExperiences":[],"displayName":"Dez C.","location":{"country":"United States","city":"The Bronx"}},{"firstName":"Gerald","lastInitial":"C","username":"geraldchainlab","avatarUrl":"https://ucarecdn.com/8961440d-1406-46af-a73a-580f216e112a/","displayCountry":"United States","city":"Vancouver","discipline":"blockchain","seniority":"senior","jobTypesOpenTo":"permanent","timeZoneOffset":-18000,"jobRole":"engineering","jobTitle":"","about":"Gerald Clemons is a professional \u003cem\u003eblockchain\u003c/em\u003e 😎developer involved in many \u003cem\u003eblockchain\u003c/em\u003e startups like Top Network, Veem, Privi. He has personally released many successful DeFi and NFT projects on several networks.\n\n☁️ Deliverables\n\nDApps, NFT Marketplace, Smart contracts, Trading bots, ICO, DEX, \u003cem\u003eBlockchain\u003c/em\u003e consultancy, Crypto games (ex. NFT games), Frontend with React.js and Vue.js\n\n☁️ Programming languages\n\nJavascript, Rust, \u003cem\u003eSolidity\u003c/em\u003e, Node.js, C++, Python, PHP, HTML, CSS, XML\n\n☁️ Frontend stacks\n\nReact.js, Vue.js, Seed (Rust) MaterialUI, Material Bootstrap, Tailwind.css, Pure.css, Figma\n\n☁️ \u003cem\u003eBlockchain\u003c/em\u003e stacks\n\nEthereum, Binance, Terra, Proton \u003cem\u003eSolidity\u003c/em\u003e, Truffle, CosmWasm, \u003cem\u003eweb3\u003c/em\u003e.js\n\n☁️ Others\n\nFirebase, AWS, Graphql, Swagger, MicroServices, Azure, MongoAtlas\n\nDocker, Jenkins, CircleCI, GitLab, Selenium MySql, MongoDB, Sqlite UML,\n\nFlowChart Linux, macOS, iOS, Android\n\nIf you are going to build a \u003cem\u003eblockchain\u003c/em\u003e project, don't hesitate to get in touch with Gerald. He is open to working now.","vetted":true,"expertises":[{"displayName":"\u003cem\u003eSolidity\u003c/em\u003e","urlString":"solidity","experience":10,"hasSufficientLocalTalent":false},{"displayName":"\u003cem\u003eBlockchain\u003c/em\u003e","urlString":"blockchain","experience":10,"hasSufficientLocalTalent":false},{"displayName":"Ethereum","urlString":"ethereum","experience":10,"hasSufficientLocalTalent":false},{"displayName":"JavaScript","urlString":"javascript","experience":10,"hasSufficientLocalTalent":false},{"displayName":"Rust","urlString":"rust","experience":9,"hasSufficientLocalTalent":false},{"displayName":"Cryptocurrency","urlString":"cryptocurrency","experience":9,"hasSufficientLocalTalent":false},{"displayName":"Vue.js","urlString":"vue","hasSufficientLocalTalent":false}],"companyTypes":["Startup"],"employments":[{"companyLogo":null,"companyName":"JFactory","categories":[{"urlString":"solidity","name":"\u003cem\u003eSolidity\u003c/em\u003e","hasSufficientLocalTalent":false},{"urlString":"vue","name":"Vue.js","hasSufficient